# Requests for the API, for the REST Client extension in VS Code.
#
# Install "REST Client" by Huachao Mao, start the API with npm start, then
# click "Send Request" above any request below. Check the status codes, not
# only the bodies.
#
# The logins work from Task 2 on. Before that, the writes need the fixed
# token from .env: replace {{admin}} below with your API_TOKEN.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@admin_token = dhuwiuub739bfwiy (a test token only used for this project)


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task 2: logging in. Send these two first: later requests reuse the tokens.

### the admin: expect 200 and a token
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin-pw" }

### an instructor: expect 200 and a token
# @name loginEinstein
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "einstein", "password": "einstein-pw" }

###
@admin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
@einstein = {{loginEinstein.response.body.token}}

### a wrong password: expect 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "guess" }


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reading: open to everybody.

### the collection: expect 200 and { total, limit, offset, items }
GET {{host}}/instructors

### one department only
GET {{host}}/instructors?dept=Comp.%20Sci.

### the second page of three: total is still 12
GET {{host}}/instructors?limit=3&offset=3

### one instructor, without the salary
GET {{host}}/instructors/22222

### Task 1: the departments, without budgets
GET {{host}}/departments

### Task 1: one department
GET {{host}}/departments/Music

### Task 1: no such department: expect 404
GET {{host}}/departments/Nursing


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task 1: hiring, as the admin.

### hire: expect 201, a Location header, and budgetLeft 50000
POST {{host}}/departments/Music/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "90100", "name": "Novice", "salary": 30000 }

### the same id again: expect 409
POST {{host}}/departments/Music/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "90100", "name": "Novice", "salary": 30000 }

### more than the budget: expect 409, and nothing is stored
POST {{host}}/departments/Music/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "90200", "name": "Expensive", "salary": 999999 }

### a bad body: expect 400
POST {{host}}/departments/Music/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nameless" }

### clean up: expect 204. The budget stays reduced: set it back to 80000
### by hand, or run npm run check, which does it for you
DELETE {{host}}/instructors/90100
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task 2: the guard.

### no token: expect 401
PUT {{host}}/instructors/22222
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 95000 }

### a token that is not ours: expect 401
PUT {{host}}/instructors/22222
Authorization: Bearer guess
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 95000 }


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task 3: who may do what.

### Einstein may not change a salary, not even his own: expect 403
PUT {{host}}/instructors/22222
Authorization: Bearer {{einstein}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 95000 }

### the admin may: expect 200
PUT {{host}}/instructors/22222
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 95000 }

### Einstein's own salary: expect 200
GET {{host}}/instructors/22222/salary
Authorization: Bearer {{einstein}}

### Katz's salary, asked by Einstein: expect 403
GET {{host}}/instructors/45565/salary
Authorization: Bearer {{einstein}}

### Katz's salary, asked by the admin: expect 200
GET {{host}}/instructors/45565/salary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
